# A CHANNEL DUG TO 1.31 m. Under `env.WADE_MAX` (1.37) so HE can cross it, and well over what any creature
# on foot will follow him into (`foe.wadeLimit` — 0.81 m for a 1.8 m body). The toad and the lurker are
# waterfaring and have no limit at all, so the water is a door for exactly two things in the bestiary.
